============================================================
Production — Ubuntu Server · Tailscale MagicDNS · Caddy
Copy this file to .env and fill in the real values
chmod 600 .env ← IMPORTANT (contains secrets)
============================================================
--- Server ---
Tailscale MagicDNS hostname (e.g., yourserver.yourtailscale.ts.net)
APP_HOST=yourserver.yourtailscale.ts.net

GitHub owner (org) for GHCR images
GHCR_OWNER=paz-dev-com

Image tag to deploy (latest = most recent image built on main)
IMAGE_TAG=latest

Root directory for persistent Docker data on the server
DATA_ROOT=/srv/docker/mediahandler

--- Database ---
Ubuntu Server = x86_64 → SQL Server 2022 (not azure-sql-edge)
DB_SA_PASSWORD=ReplaceWithStrongPassword123!

--- Auth0 / Okta (Backend .NET) ---
Must include trailing slash for OIDC discovery
OKTA_DOMAIN=https://your-tenant.eu.auth0.com/
OKTA_CLIENT_ID=your-backend-client-id
OKTA_CLIENT_SECRET=your-backend-client-secret

Must match the API Identifier in Auth0
OKTA_AUDIENCE=https://yourserver.yourtailscale.ts.net/api/v1

--- TMDB ---
TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN=tmdb-read-access-token

--- Freebox NAS ---
NAS_APP_ID=mediahandler
NAS_APP_TOKEN=your-freebox-app-token
NAS_BASE_PATH_0=/Disque dur/Media/Films
NAS_BASE_PATH_1=/Disque dur/Media/Series
NAS_FREEBOX_URL=http://mafreebox.freebox.fr